      "reason": "Grants the acting user (agent) workspace membership in Northwind Labs so users.info/users.list and conversations discovery for that workspace's public #field-ops channel and user_teams facts are reachable through documented APIs, without altering the fact that Carlos is the sole channel_members row in #field-ops."
